attacks.  Finger of Death will work if you don't wake him/her by 
being visible and non-stealthy, so you can hit before the Amulet
is picked up.  (i.e. be invisible, check the door for traps,
hit the Dork One from outside the room with the finger.)

  Once you've got the Eye of Aethopica you're in business as
a wizard.  You don't have to wear the amulet to get magic 
resistance and mana regeration.


