  Looks pretty good.  Do the quest and make sure you get and 
wield Magicbane.  Wonderful use of the spell of sleep.

  Max out your strength and enchant Magicbane to +6/7.  That
way you won't need to unwield Magicbane for a better weapon
(and lose that lovely curse resistance, especially on the
ascension run.)

  Don't waste a wish on scrolls of charging, you can write them.

  Other than dragon scale mail, looks like you should wish for a
"Blessed fixed greased +2 helm of brilliance", or +3 if you 
prefer.  Get it to +5 (trim with spell of Drain Life if it goes
to +4).  (Wis + Int) greater than 44 increases your mana 
regeneration.  Higher Wis gives more Pw gain per level gain.

  You get the Hp and Pw gain even if you're already at Exp level
30!

  The VotD is a great place to increase experience levels (Some
of my earlier posts describe the technique.  Warning: requires
patience.)  

  Your charisma is almost perfect for foocubi dancing.  Were you
trying for that or were you just being obssessive?

  If it looks like I'm mad with lust for Pw, you're right.  500+
Pw, the Eye, exp level 30, and (Int+Wis) > 44 means you'll use
spells forever more.

  The spell of magic missile also becomes more effective with 
higher experience levels.

  Magic markers from then on.  One magic marker should let you 
write the spellbook of turn undead (if you don't already have it)
with many charges to spare.  Then write enchant armor/weapon (if 
you don't choose to try for those through polying).  

  Replace your T-shirt by polying armor at the Castle.  (Write
the spellbook if you have to, although writing create monster
might be more efficient.  With +CM and the Eye, extended 
sacrifests should give you almost every spell book.  Note that
higher character level increases your chances of getting a new 
spellbook instead of a duplicate.

  Try on every non-cursed small shield and gloves at the Castle
first.  At your level GoDex aren't that helpful, and finding 
enchanted armor saves scrolls of EA.

